t/pulls/104269","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104269#pullrequestreview-2765180124"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104269"}},"submitted_at":"2025-04-14T18:09:20Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2769219530,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6lDu_K","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Works great now!\r\n\r\nI noticed one issue with particles interpolation in the TPS demo though (which didn't occur in `master`). When you fire a bullet, the particles will create a streak between a fixed position in the world and the bullet's initial position:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/45d8230c-c184-4900-8981-65feba38b696\r\n\r\nThis may be a game code issue that's highlighted by the PR, but it didn't happen before (I've double-checked it).","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104269#pullrequestreview-2769219530","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104269","author_associat